    // Simpler: if any MD001 warnings were added, rebuild correctly by removing them and running correct algorithm when headings.len()>1 and a skip occurred not at last.
    // We'll check if rebuilding is needed: remove last added warnings for this rule and re-add correct if the naive prev logic differed.
